<title>USA: Ingersoll-Dresser wins Kodak agreement.</title>
<headline>Ingersoll-Dresser wins Kodak agreement.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingersoll-Dresser Pump Co said on Tuesday it entered into an agreement to supply Eastman Kodak Co plants with industrial pumps.</p>
<p>The value of the three-year deal was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Ingersoll-Dresser is a joint venture of Ingersoll-Rand Co and Dresser Industries Inc .</p>
<p>Ingersoll-Dresser will supply pumps and pump-related services for Kodak plants in the United States, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, the United Kingdom, France and Australia, the company said.</p>
</text>
